<title>JAPAN: Green Cross to announce earnings forecast revision.</title>
<headline>Green Cross to announce earnings forecast revision.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese drug maker Green Cross Corp said it would hold a news conference at 3.30 p.m. (0630 GMT) on Thursday at its Osaka headquarters to announce a revision of its earnings forecast for the first half of the 1996/97 business year and announce a new president.</p>
</text>
